LOCATION:Luna Beach Club\, Jl. Kayangan\, Beraban\, Kec. Kediri Tabanan
DESCRIPTION:FAMBULA - BALI....is back once again! THE FAT 'N" FUNKY HOUSE P
 OOL PARTY at Utopia Cave Club! This is the Bali you came for and you just 
 found the guest list so don't pay 250k on the door One day\, one night\, o
 ne feeling\, one family\, in the ultimate venue. Get ready\, Bali! FAMBULA
  — the legendary party sensation that has electrified Nairobi in Kenya \
 , stormed through London’s biggest clubs\, and set the European festival
  circuit ablaze — lands exclusively at Luna Beach Club's\, UTOPIA on Sun
 day 22nd November 2026! A Cliff-Top Cave Club with ocean views\, the fines
 t food\, perfect cocktails\, quality music. Leave the noise of town...You 
 found your oasis in Bali UTOPIA at Luna Beach Club is... - An infinity poo
 l perched over the breathtaking Nyani beach cliffs - Pumping sound system 
 in the cave - The best sunset spot in Bali — lose yourself in the golden
  hours - Party under Bali’s biggest immersive artwork: the iconic THK To
 wer - The cocktail bar is the dancefloor inside the pool or on up close wi
 th DJs - Book a cliff top sofas for lounging and dancing in style - Utopia
  is one of multiple venues for endless adventure in Luna beach Club On the
  Decks.... Pumping the funky house\, deep beats and classic cuts - Sean Do
 yle - Venuto - Tina T - Seany Rossi From sun-drenched afternoons to starli
 t nights\, move to the funky vocal house rhythms and classic anthems you l
 ove — all with that very special Fambula flavor. Classy Vibes\, Up-for-I
 t Crowd Fambula is made for party people who love to dress up or rock your
  bikini\, dance hard\, and celebrate life. It’s the place for thrill-see
 kers\, trendsetters\, and lovers of electrifying house music. With pro lig
 hting\, hypnotic immersive art\, and the most scenic party vista in all of
  Bali\, THIS is the one. Don’t miss your chance to be part of the story.
  Secure your spot\, bring your crew\, and prepare for the wildest beach cl
 ub experience ever! FAMBULA - BALI | 22nd November 2026 | Utopia Cave Club
  - Luna Beach Club - Bali Limited Guest List – reserve yours now! Ticket
 s: https://megatix.co.id/events/fambula-the-funky-house-pool-party?utm_sou
