SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Padma Musical Series: George Harliono & Hera Hyesang Park
LOCATION:Padma Resort Legian
DESCRIPTION:The Padma Musical Series returns this December with an evening 
 of classical music featuring two acclaimed international artists: British-
 Indonesian pianist George Harliono and Korean soprano Hera Hyesang Park. R
 eturning to Bali following his previous appearance at Padma Resort Legian\
 , Harliono has established an impressive international career from a remar
 kably young age. In 2023\, he received the Silver Medal at the XVII Intern
 ational Tchaikovsky Competition\, one of the most prestigious events in th
 e classical music world. His performance history includes celebrated venue
 s such as Wigmore Hall\, Royal Albert Hall\, Berlin Philharmonie Kammermus
 iksaal and Suntory Hall\, alongside appearances with orchestras including 
 the NHK Symphony Orchestra\, Tokyo Philharmonic Orchestra and Mariinsky Or
 chestra. Joining him for the December performance is Hera Hyesang Park\, m
 aking her Bali debut. A Deutsche Grammophon recording artist and graduate 
 of The Juilliard School\, the Korean soprano has performed at leading oper
 a houses and concert halls around the world\, including the Metropolitan O
 pera\, Staatsoper Berlin\, Paris Opéra and Glyndebourne Festival. Her rep
 ertoire spans celebrated works including La bohème \, La traviata \, Don 
 Giovanni and Le nozze di Figaro . Her debut album\, I Am Hera \, was relea
 sed in 2020\, followed by Breathe \, which received the 2024 Opus Klassik 
 Award for Videoclip of the Year.\n\nMore info: https://www.nowbali.co.id/u
 pcoming-events/padma-musical-series-george-harliono-hera-hyesang-park/\n\n
 Please verify with the organizer before attending.
URL:https://www.nowbali.co.id/upcoming-events/padma-musical-series-george-h
 arliono-hera-hyesang-park/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261212
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261213
END:VEVENT
