UID:6bc0e68444d93fc1b08c7056df9314d4f87cbab7@lewagon-calendar
DTSTAMP:20261101T212435Z
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:THE COPPER CHRISTMAS
LOCATION:Copper Kitchen\, Bar & Rooftop\, Jalan Bisma 68\, Ubud Kel.\, Ubud
 \, Gianyar\, 80571\, Indonesia
DESCRIPTION:THE COPPER CHRISTMAS A 5-course Feast for The Festive Season Ce
 lebrate Christmas above the rooftops of Ubud with The Copper Christmas\, a
  five-course festive dinner designed for gathering\, savoring\, and celebr
 ating the season together. From 24–26 December 2026\, Copper Kitchen\, B
 ar & Rooftop brings its signature dining experience to the festive season\
 , pairing thoughtfully crafted flavors with an elevated evening overlookin
 g Ubud. Gather around the table for a five-course feast featuring Land & S
 ea selections or a beautifully crafted Vegetarian menu\, with optional win
 e pairings to complement every course. As the evening unfolds\, enjoy live
  music from 7:30 PM to 9:00 PM while taking in the festive atmosphere of C
 opper. On 24 and 25 December\, the celebration becomes even more special w
 ith children singing Christmas carols accompanied by the traditional sound
 s of the angklung. Whether you are celebrating Christmas with family\, gat
 hering with friends\, or looking for a memorable Christmas dinner in Ubud\
 , The Copper Christmas offers an evening of exceptional food\, wine\, fest
 ive cocktails\, live music\, and good company high above the heart of Ubud
 . CHRISTMAS DINNER IN UBUD\, ABOVE THE ROOFTOPS This festive season\, take
  Christmas celebrations to new heights at Copper Kitchen\, Bar & Rooftop. 
 Set above the heart of Ubud\, The Copper Christmas brings together a five-
 course feast\, festive flavors\, live music\, and the joy of gathering aro
 und the table. Choose between the Land & Sea menu or a thoughtfully crafte
 d Vegetarian menu\, with optional wine pairings available to complement th
 e evening. From the first course to the final toast\, every detail is desi
 gned for a Christmas dinner worth lingering over. With Ubud’s rooftops s
 tretching beyond the table and festive sounds filling the evening\, Copper
  offers a memorable setting for families\, friends\, and loved ones celebr
 ating Christmas in Bali. A FESTIVE TABLE FOR EVERYONE Christmas is best en
 joyed together. Whether it is an intimate dinner for two\, a long-awaited 
 gathering with friends\, or a festive family celebration\, The Copper Chri
 stmas invites everyone to come together over good food and good company. O
 n 24 and 25 December\, children’s Christmas carols accompanied by the tr
 aditional sounds of the angklung bring a distinctly Indonesian touch to th
 e celebration\, creating a festive evening that feels both joyful and uniq
 uely connected to Bali. FESTIVE COCKTAILS AT COPPER Start the evening with
  something festive. Copper’s specially crafted festive cocktails will be
  available from 5:00 PM to 7:00 PM\, offering the perfect way to begin you
 r Christmas celebration above Ubud. Join us early\, raise a glass\, and se
 ttle into the festive spirit before dinner begins. EVENT DETAILS DATES: Th
 ursday-Saturday\, 24\, 25\, 26\, December 2026 DINNER: 5.30 pm to 11 pm LI
