 ERS UBUD A Five-Course Mediterranean-Inspired New Year’s Eve Dinner & Ce
 lebration Welcome the new year with an unforgettable New Year’s Eve dinn
 er in Ubud at Embers Mediterranean Restaurant. On 31 December 2026\, Ember
 s presents The Midnight Fire\, a five-course Mediterranean-inspired dinner
  and New Year’s Eve celebration bringing together bold flavors\, fire-le
 d cooking\, festive cocktails\, live music\, and the warmth of gathering a
 round the table. Inspired by the vibrant culinary traditions of the Medite
 rranean\, the evening begins with beautifully crafted courses including te
 nder snapper carpaccio and wild mushroom cappuccino\, before building towa
 rd indulgent wood-fired selections such as lobster or Wagyu striploin. A t
 houghtfully created vegetarian menu is also available\, ensuring everyone 
 can join the celebration. As dinner unfolds\, the atmosphere shifts into t
 he evening’s celebration\, with Smooth Acoustic live music from 9:30 PM 
 to 12:30 AM\, creating the perfect soundtrack as you count down to 2027 be
 neath the Ubud night sky. NEW YEAR’S EVE DINNER IN UBUD\, BY THE FIRE Th
 ere is something special about ending the year around a table. At Embers\,
  fire is at the heart of the experience. Our Mediterranean-inspired cuisin
 e celebrates quality ingredients\, thoughtful technique\, and the natural 
 character that comes from cooking over flame. The Midnight Fire brings thi
 s philosophy to the festive season with a five-course dinner created espec
 ially for New Year’s Eve. Choose between our Land & Sea or Vegetarian me
 nu\, elevate the experience with a wine pairing\, and begin the evening wi
 th a festive cocktail during our early-evening cocktail service. Then\, as
  the night deepens\, let live music carry you toward midnight and into the
  first moments of 2027. A MEDITERRANEAN NEW YEAR’S EVE IN UBUD Whether y
 ou are celebrating with your partner\, gathering with friends\, or sharing
  the occasion with family\, The Midnight Fire offers a relaxed yet festive
  way to welcome the new year. Expect generous flavors\, thoughtful craftsm
 anship\, fire-kissed dishes\, handcrafted drinks\, live music\, and an atm
 osphere designed for lingering long after dinner is finished. This is New 
 Year’s Eve in Ubud\, the Embers way — warm\, flavorful\, and made for 
 memorable moments. EVENT DETAILS Dates: Thursday\, 31 December 2026 Dinner
 : 6:00 PM–11:00 PM Live Music: 9:30 PM–12:30 AM DINNER & WINE PAIRING 
