 wine pairing Vegetarian IDR 950.000++ per person IDR 1.500.000++ per perso
 n with wine pairing Festive Cocktails IDR 150.000++ per cocktail Available
  from 5:00 PM–7:00 PM only WELCOME 2027 AT EMBERS Make your final dinner
  of 2026 one to remember. Gather around the fire\, raise a glass\, savor a
  five-course Mediterranean-inspired feast\, and let the music carry you in
 to a brand-new year. The Midnight Fire awaits at Embers Ubud on 31 Decembe
 r 2026. Reserve your table and celebrate New Year’s Eve in Ubud with an 
